   "q": "<p>Bir parkın koordinat düzlemine çizilmiş planında yeşil çim alan, mavi havuz ve turuncu kamelya gösterilmiştir. Kamelya, döndürülmeden yeni bir yere taşınacaktır. Yeni yerinde kamelya</p><ul><li>tamamen çim alanın içinde kalmalı,</li><li>havuzla hiçbir ortak noktası olmamalıdır (havuzun kenarına da değmemelidir).</li></ul><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 430 334\" width=\"430\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Koordinat düzleminde çim alan dikdörtgeni, içinde havuz dikdörtgeni ve sol altta kamelya dikdörtgeni\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"430\" height=\"334\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"46\" width=\"338\" height=\"260\" fill=\"#dcfce7\" stroke=\"#15803d\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><rect x=\"170\" y=\"150\" width=\"104\" height=\"78\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><rect x=\"66\" y=\"228\" width=\"78\" height=\"52\" fill=\"#fdba74\" stroke=\"#9a3412\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><path d=\"M40 20V306M66 20V306M92 20V306M118 20V306M144 20V306M170 20V306M196 20V306M222 20V306M248 20V306M274 20V306M300 20V306M326 20V306M352 20V306M378 20V306M404 20V306M40 20H404M40 46H404M40 72H404M40 98H404M40 124H404M40 150H404M40 176H404M40 202H404M40 228H404M40 254H404M40 280H404M40 306H404\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-opacity=\"0.3\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M40 306H410M40 306V14\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"416,306 408,302 408,310\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><polygon points=\"40,8 36,16 44,16\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><g font-size=\"13\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#1e293b\"><text x=\"414\" y=\"324\">x</text><text x=\"48\" y=\"16\">y</text></g><g font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"222\" y=\"194\">Havuz</text><text x=\"105\" y=\"259\">Kamelya</text><text x=\"326\" y=\"88\">Çim alan</text></g><g font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><text x=\"34\" y=\"322\">0</text><text x=\"66\" y=\"322\">1</text><text x=\"92\" y=\"322\">2</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"322\">3</text><text x=\"144\" y=\"322\">4</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"322\">5</text><text x=\"196\" y=\"322\">6</text><text x=\"222\" y=\"322\">7</text><text x=\"248\" y=\"322\">8</text><text x=\"274\" y=\"322\">9</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"322\">10</text><text x=\"326\" y=\"322\">11</text><text x=\"352\" y=\"322\">12</text><text x=\"378\" y=\"322\">13</text><text x=\"404\" y=\"322\">14</text></g><g font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"end\"><text x=\"33\" y=\"284\">1</text><text x=\"33\" y=\"258\">2</text><text x=\"33\" y=\"232\">3</text><text x=\"33\" y=\"206\">4</text><text x=\"33\" y=\"180\">5</text><text x=\"33\" y=\"154\">6</text><text x=\"33\" y=\"128\">7</text><text x=\"33\" y=\"102\">8</text><text x=\"33\" y=\"76\">9</text><text x=\"33\" y=\"50\">10</text><text x=\"33\" y=\"24\">11</text></g></svg></div><p><b>Buna göre kamelyaya aşağıdaki ötelemelerden hangisi uygulanabilir?</b></p>",
