   "a": "B",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Tarh d’nin sağında beşgen: d üzerinde 6 m, üst ve alt yatay kenar 3’er m.</li> <li>Eğik kenarlar: yatayda 4, düşeyde 3 kare.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Tarh ve d’ye göre yansımasından oluşan yeni tarhın çevresi.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Eğik kenarı bul</b> Eğik kenar, dik kenarları 4 ve 3 olan dik üçgenin hipotenüsüdür. <span class=\"sv-m\">√(4² + 3²) = √25 = 5 m</span></li> <li><b>Görüntünün kenarları</b> Yansıma uzunlukları korur; d’nin solundaki parçanın dış kenarları da 3, 5, 5, 3 m olur.</li> <li><b>Ortak kenarı ayıkla</b> d üzerindeki 6 m’lik kenar iki parçanın birleştiği yerdedir; tarhın içinde kalır, çite girmez.</li> <li><b>Çevreyi topla</b> İki yarının dış kenarları. <span class=\"sv-m\">2 · (3 + 5 + 5 + 3) = 2 · 16 = 32 m</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 510 270\" width=\"510\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"d doğrusuna göre simetrik iki beşgen; dış kenarlar 3, 5, 5, 3 m, d üzerindeki kenar içte\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"510\" height=\"270\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><path d=\"M45 30V240M75 30V240M105 30V240M135 30V240M165 30V240M195 30V240M225 30V240M255 30V240M285 30V240M315 30V240M345 30V240M375 30V240M405 30V240M435 30V240M465 30V240M30 225H480M30 195H480M30 165H480M30 135H480M30 105H480M30 75H480M30 45H480\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"255,225 255,45 345,45 465,135 345,225\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" fill-opacity=\"0.45\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"255,225 255,45 165,45 45,135 165,225\" fill=\"#d9f99d\" fill-opacity=\"0.5\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"255\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"255\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><line x1=\"345\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"345\" y2=\"135\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><line x1=\"345\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"465\" y2=\"135\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><text x=\"260\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">d</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"39\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">3</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"241\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">3</text><text x=\"413\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">5</text><text x=\"413\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">5</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"39\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">3</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"241\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">3</text><text x=\"97\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"end\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">5</text><text x=\"97\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"end\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">5</text><text x=\"261\" y=\"139\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">6 m içte</text><text x=\"405\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">4</text><text x=\"340\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" text-anchor=\"end\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">3</text></svg><figcaption>d üzerindeki kenar birleşimin içinde kalır; çit yalnız dış kenarlardan geçer.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Şekil ile görüntüsü bir kenarla birleşiyorsa çevre = 2 · (şeklin çevresi − ortak kenar).</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Ortak kenarı bir kez eklemek 38, iki kez eklemek 44; eğik kenarı 4 sanmak 28 verir.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>B</b></div></div>"
