   "q": "<p>Bir tasarım programında koordinat düzlemine yarı saydam mavi renkli ABCD dikdörtgeni çiziliyor.</p>\n<div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 270\" width=\"300\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Koordinat düzleminde x eksenini kesen, köşeleri kare köşelerinde olan mavi ABCD dikdörtgeni\"><path d=\"M20,244V24M42,244V24M64,244V24M86,244V24M108,244V24M130,244V24M152,244V24M174,244V24M196,244V24M218,244V24M240,244V24M262,244V24M20,244H262M20,222H262M20,200H262M20,178H262M20,156H262M20,134H262M20,112H262M20,90H262M20,68H262M20,46H262M20,24H262\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"134\" x2=\"272\" y2=\"134\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"280,134 270,129 270,139\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><line x1=\"174\" y1=\"244\" x2=\"174\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"174,6 169,16 179,16\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"274\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"13\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#1e293b\">x</text><text x=\"183\" y=\"14\" font-size=\"13\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#1e293b\">y</text><polygon points=\"42,178 152,178 152,46 42,46\" fill=\"#60a5fa\" fill-opacity=\"0.35\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/><g font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\"><text x=\"20\" y=\"149\">−7</text><text x=\"42\" y=\"149\">−6</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"149\">−5</text><text x=\"86\" y=\"149\">−4</text><text x=\"108\" y=\"149\">−3</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"149\">−2</text><text x=\"152\" y=\"149\">−1</text><text x=\"196\" y=\"149\">1</text><text x=\"218\" y=\"149\">2</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"149\">3</text><text x=\"262\" y=\"149\">4</text></g><g font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\"><text x=\"179\" y=\"248\">−5</text><text x=\"179\" y=\"226\">−4</text><text x=\"179\" y=\"204\">−3</text><text x=\"179\" y=\"182\">−2</text><text x=\"179\" y=\"160\">−1</text><text x=\"179\" y=\"116\">1</text><text x=\"179\" y=\"94\">2</text><text x=\"179\" y=\"72\">3</text><text x=\"179\" y=\"50\">4</text><text x=\"179\" y=\"28\">5</text></g><text x=\"37\" y=\"194\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">A</text><text x=\"147\" y=\"194\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">B</text><text x=\"147\" y=\"41\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">C</text><text x=\"37\" y=\"41\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">D</text></svg></div>\n<p>Dikdörtgenin bir kopyası alınıyor. Kopya önce <b>3 birim sağa</b> ötelenip ardından <b>x eksenine göre</b> yansıtılıyor ve yarı saydam sarıya boyanıyor. Mavi dikdörtgen ile kopyanın son hâlinin üst üste geldiği bölge yeşil görünüyor.</p>\n<p><b>Buna göre yeşil görünen bölgenin alanı kaç birimkaredir?</b></p>",
