   "a": "B",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Mavi ABCD: A(−6, −2), B(−1, −2), C(−1, 4), D(−6, 4)</li> <li>Kopya: önce 3 birim sağa, sonra x eksenine göre yansıma.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Mavi dikdörtgen ile kopyanın son hâlinin ortak (yeşil) bölgesinin alanı.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Aralıklarla düşün</b> Mavi dikdörtgen −6 ≤ x ≤ −1 ve −2 ≤ y ≤ 4 aralığındadır.</li> <li><b>3 birim sağa</b> Apsislere 3 eklenir, ordinatlar aynı kalır. <span class=\"sv-m\">−3 ≤ x ≤ 2,  −2 ≤ y ≤ 4</span></li> <li><b>x eksenine göre yansıma</b> Ordinatların işareti değişir; −2…4 aralığı −4…2 olur. <span class=\"sv-m\">−3 ≤ x ≤ 2,  −4 ≤ y ≤ 2</span></li> <li><b>Ortak bölge</b> İki aralığın kesişimini al. <span class=\"sv-m\">x: −3 ile −1 arası → 2 birim</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">y: −2 ile 2 arası → 4 birim</span> <span class=\"sv-m\">Alan = 2 · 4 = 8 birimkare</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 340 340\" width=\"340\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Mavi ABCD dikdörtgeni, sarı kesikli kopyanın son hâli ve yeşil 2×4 ortak bölge\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"340\" height=\"340\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><path d=\"M30 30V310M58 30V310M86 30V310M114 30V310M142 30V310M170 30V310M198 30V310M226 30V310M254 30V310M282 30V310M310 30V310M30 310H310M30 282H310M30 254H310M30 226H310M30 198H310M30 170H310M30 142H310M30 114H310M30 86H310M30 58H310M30 30H310\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M26 170H316 M226 314V24\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"322,170 314,166 314,174\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><polygon points=\"226,18 222,26 230,26\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"316\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"14\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#1e293b\">x</text><text x=\"234\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"14\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#1e293b\">y</text><g font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\"><text x=\"30\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−7</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−6</text><text x=\"86\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−5</text><text x=\"114\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−4</text><text x=\"142\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−3</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−2</text><text x=\"198\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−1</text><text x=\"254\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"282\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text x=\"310\" y=\"185\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><text x=\"221\" y=\"314.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">−5</text><text x=\"221\" y=\"286.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">−4</text><text x=\"221\" y=\"258.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">−3</text><text x=\"221\" y=\"230.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">−2</text><text x=\"221\" y=\"202.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">−1</text><text x=\"221\" y=\"146.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><text x=\"221\" y=\"118.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><text x=\"221\" y=\"90.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">3</text><text x=\"221\" y=\"62.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">4</text><text x=\"221\" y=\"34.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">5</text><text x=\"222\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text></g><polygon points=\"58,226 198,226 198,58 58,58\" fill=\"#60a5fa\" fill-opacity=\"0.4\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"142,282 282,282 282,114 142,114\" fill=\"#fde047\" fill-opacity=\"0.45\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"142,226 198,226 198,114 142,114\" fill=\"#16a34a\" fill-opacity=\"0.6\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"58\" cy=\"226\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"52\" y=\"242\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"end\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">A</text><circle cx=\"198\" cy=\"226\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"202\" y=\"242\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">B</text><circle cx=\"198\" cy=\"58\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"204\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">C</text><circle cx=\"58\" cy=\"58\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"52\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"end\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">D</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"147\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#14532d\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">2 × 4</text></svg><figcaption>Yeşil bölge 2 birim genişliğinde, 4 birim yüksekliğindedir.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Dikdörtgenlerde her köşeyi ayrı ayrı taşımak yerine x ve y aralıklarını taşımak daha hızlıdır.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Yansımayı unutmak 12, ötelemeyi unutmak 20, y eksenine göre yansıtmak 6 verir.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>B</b></div></div>"
