   "lv": "zor",
   "q": "<p>Bir oyunda P noktasındaki hazine sandığına sırasıyla şu iki dönüşüm uygulanıyor:</p><p><b>1.</b> d doğrusuna (x = 2 doğrusu) göre yansıma<br><b>2.</b> 3 birim sola ve 4 birim yukarı öteleme</p><p>İki dönüşümden sonra sandık, aşağıdaki koordinat düzleminde gösterilen P″ noktasına geliyor.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 404 308\" width=\"410\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Koordinat düzleminde x = 2 doğrusu d ve P″(−4, 1) noktası\" font-family=\"sans-serif\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"404\" height=\"308\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><path d=\"M22 286V22M46 286V22M70 286V22M94 286V22M118 286V22M142 286V22M166 286V22M190 286V22M214 286V22M238 286V22M262 286V22M286 286V22M310 286V22M334 286V22M358 286V22M382 286V22M22 286H382M22 262H382M22 238H382M22 214H382M22 190H382M22 166H382M22 142H382M22 118H382M22 94H382M22 70H382M22 46H382M22 22H382\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"/><line x1=\"12.4\" y1=\"166\" x2=\"394\" y2=\"166\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"394,166 385,161.5 385,170.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><polygon points=\"12.4,166 21.4,170.5 21.4,161.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><line x1=\"166\" y1=\"295.6\" x2=\"166\" y2=\"10\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"166,10 161.5,19 170.5,19\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><polygon points=\"166,295.6 170.5,286.6 161.5,286.6\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><line x1=\"214\" y1=\"286\" x2=\"214\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"142\" r=\"3.6\" fill=\"#2563eb\"/><text x=\"396\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-style=\"italic\">x</text><text x=\"158\" y=\"16\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-style=\"italic\">y</text><text x=\"22\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−6</text><text x=\"46\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−5</text><text x=\"70\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−4</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−3</text><text x=\"118\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−2</text><text x=\"142\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−1</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">1</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2</text><text x=\"238\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">3</text><text x=\"262\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">4</text><text x=\"286\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">5</text><text x=\"310\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">6</text><text x=\"334\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">7</text><text x=\"358\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">8</text><text x=\"382\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">9</text><text x=\"161\" y=\"290\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−5</text><text x=\"161\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−4</text><text x=\"161\" y=\"242\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−3</text><text x=\"161\" y=\"218\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−2</text><text x=\"161\" y=\"194\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">−1</text><text x=\"161\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">1</text><text x=\"161\" y=\"122\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">2</text><text x=\"161\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">3</text><text x=\"161\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">4</text><text x=\"161\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">5</text><text x=\"161\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">6</text><text x=\"161\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">0</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"15\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#dc2626\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-style=\"italic\">d</text><text x=\"76\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#2563eb\" font-weight=\"bold\">P″</text></svg></div><p><b>Buna göre sandığın başlangıçta bulunduğu P noktasının koordinatları aşağıdakilerden hangisidir?</b></p>",
