   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>1. d (x = 2) doğrusuna göre yansıma; 2. 3 birim sola, 4 birim yukarı öteleme.</li> <li>Son nokta P″(−4, 1)</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Başlangıç noktası P.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Geri dönüş fikri</b> Son noktadan başlayıp dönüşümleri ters sırayla ve ters yönde geri alalım.</li> <li><b>Ötelemeyi geri al</b> “3 sola, 4 yukarı”nın tersi “3 sağa, 4 aşağı”dır. <span class=\"sv-m\">P″(−4, 1) → P′(−1, −3)</span></li> <li><b>Yansımayı geri al</b> Yansımanın tersi yine aynı yansımadır. P′, d’nin 3 birim solunda; P, 3 birim sağında olur. <span class=\"sv-m\">2 + 3 = 5 → P(5, −3)</span></li> <li><b>Kontrol</b> P’ye dönüşümleri sırasıyla uygula. <span class=\"sv-m\">(5, −3) → (−1, −3) → (−4, 1) ✓</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 434 264\" width=\"434\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"P″’den 3 sağa 4 aşağı ötelemeyle P′’ye, P′’den x = 2 doğrusuna göre yansımayla P’ye geri dönüş\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"434\" height=\"264\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><path d=\"M30 30V234M64 30V234M98 30V234M132 30V234M166 30V234M200 30V234M234 30V234M268 30V234M302 30V234M336 30V234M370 30V234M404 30V234M30 234H404M30 200H404M30 166H404M30 132H404M30 98H404M30 64H404M30 30H404\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M26 98H410 M200 238V24\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"416,98 408,94 408,102\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><polygon points=\"200,18 196,26 204,26\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"410\" y=\"90\" font-size=\"14\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#1e293b\">x</text><text x=\"208\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"14\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#1e293b\">y</text><g font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\"><text x=\"30\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−5</text><text x=\"64\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−4</text><text x=\"98\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−3</text><text x=\"132\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−2</text><text x=\"166\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−1</text><text x=\"234\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"268\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text x=\"302\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><text x=\"336\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><text x=\"370\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><text x=\"404\" y=\"113\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><text x=\"195\" y=\"238.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">−4</text><text x=\"195\" y=\"204.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">−3</text><text x=\"195\" y=\"170.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">−2</text><text x=\"195\" y=\"136.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">−1</text><text x=\"195\" y=\"68.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><text x=\"195\" y=\"34.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><text x=\"196\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text></g><line x1=\"268\" y1=\"234\" x2=\"268\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><line x1=\"64\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"156.6\" y2=\"186.9\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><polygon points=\"162.6,194.9 152.6,189.9 160.6,183.9\" fill=\"#7c3aed\"/><line x1=\"166\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"353.2\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><polygon points=\"363.2,200 353.2,205 353.2,195\" fill=\"#0e7490\"/><text x=\"273\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">d: x = 2</text><circle cx=\"64\" cy=\"64\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#7c3aed\"/><text x=\"70\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">P″(−4, 1)</text><circle cx=\"166\" cy=\"200\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#0e7490\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"218\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0e7490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">P′(−1, −3)</text><circle cx=\"370\" cy=\"200\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#16a34a\"/><text x=\"370\" y=\"218\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#16a34a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">P(5, −3)</text><text x=\"126.4\" y=\"121.8\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">3 sağa, 4 aşağı</text><text x=\"217\" y=\"194\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0e7490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">3</text><text x=\"319\" y=\"194\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0e7490\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">3</text></svg><figcaption>Önce öteleme, sonra yansıma geri alınır.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Geri alırken sırayı ters çevir: en son yapılan dönüşüm ilk geri alınır.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Yalnız ötelemeyi geri alıp yansımayı unutmak (−1, −3); dönüşümleri P″’ye yeniden uygulamak (5, 5) verir.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>C</b></div></div>"
