   "a": "B",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Mavi ABC: A(3, 6), B(−1, 0), C(5, 0)</li> <li>Sarı parça: ABC’nin d (x = 3) doğrusuna göre yansıması; 1 birim = 1 dm</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>İki parçanın birlikte kapladığı alan.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Görüntüyü bul</b> A d üzerinde olduğundan yerinde kalır. B, d’nin 4 birim solunda; C, 2 birim sağında. <span class=\"sv-m\">A′ = A(3, 6),  B′(7, 0),  C′(1, 0)</span></li> <li><b>Her parçanın alanı</b> Taban |BC| = 6, yükseklik 6. <span class=\"sv-m\">(6 · 6) ÷ 2 = 18 dm² (sarı da 18)</span></li> <li><b>Ortak bölge</b> İki tabanın ortak kısmı C′(1, 0) ile C(5, 0) arasıdır; ortak bölge AC′C üçgenidir. <span class=\"sv-m\">(4 · 6) ÷ 2 = 12 dm²</span></li> <li><b>Birleşim</b> Ortak bölgeyi bir kez say. <span class=\"sv-m\">18 + 18 − 12 = 24 dm²</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 420 312\" width=\"420\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Mavi ABC üçgeni, x = 3 doğrusuna göre sarı yansıması ve yeşil ortak AC′C üçgeni\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"312\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><path d=\"M30 30V282M66 30V282M102 30V282M138 30V282M174 30V282M210 30V282M246 30V282M282 30V282M318 30V282M354 30V282M390 30V282M30 282H390M30 246H390M30 210H390M30 174H390M30 138H390M30 102H390M30 66H390M30 30H390\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M26 282H396 M102 286V24\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"402,282 394,278 394,286\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><polygon points=\"102,18 98,26 106,26\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"396\" y=\"274\" font-size=\"14\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#1e293b\">x</text><text x=\"110\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"14\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#1e293b\">y</text><g font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\"><text x=\"30\" y=\"297\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−2</text><text x=\"66\" y=\"297\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−1</text><text x=\"138\" y=\"297\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"174\" y=\"297\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"297\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><text x=\"246\" y=\"297\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><text x=\"282\" y=\"297\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><text x=\"318\" y=\"297\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><text x=\"354\" y=\"297\" text-anchor=\"middle\">7</text><text x=\"390\" y=\"297\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text><text x=\"97\" y=\"250.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><text x=\"97\" y=\"214.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><text x=\"97\" y=\"178.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">3</text><text x=\"97\" y=\"142.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">4</text><text x=\"97\" y=\"106.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">5</text><text x=\"97\" y=\"70.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">6</text><text x=\"97\" y=\"34.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">7</text><text x=\"98\" y=\"296\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text></g><polygon points=\"210,66 66,282 282,282\" fill=\"#60a5fa\" fill-opacity=\"0.35\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"210,66 354,282 138,282\" fill=\"#fde047\" fill-opacity=\"0.4\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"210,66 138,282 282,282\" fill=\"#16a34a\" fill-opacity=\"0.45\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"282\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">d: x = 3</text><circle cx=\"210\" cy=\"66\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"218\" y=\"60\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">A = A′</text><circle cx=\"66\" cy=\"282\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"62\" y=\"274\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"end\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">B</text><circle cx=\"282\" cy=\"282\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"286\" y=\"274\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">C</text><circle cx=\"354\" cy=\"282\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"358\" y=\"274\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">B′</text><circle cx=\"138\" cy=\"282\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"134\" y=\"274\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"end\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">C′</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#14532d\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">ortak</text></svg><figcaption>Yeşil AC′C üçgeni iki parçada da vardır.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Simetri doğrusu üzerindeki nokta yansımada kendisine gider.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Ortak bölgeyi çıkarmamak 36, yalnız ortak bölgeyi almak 12 verir.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>B</b></div></div>"
