   "lv": "zor",
   "q": "<p>Bir kumaş desenci, aşağıdaki turuncu motifi kullanarak bir desen hazırlayacaktır. Desene koyacağı her motif, turuncu motife <b>yalnız bir öteleme</b> ya da <b>yalnız bir yansıma</b> (herhangi bir doğruya göre) uygulanarak elde edilmelidir.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 120 120\" width=\"130\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"motif\" font-family=\"sans-serif\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><path d=\"M8 112V8M34 112V8M60 112V8M86 112V8M112 112V8M8 112H112M8 86H112M8 60H112M8 34H112M8 8H112\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"8\" y=\"60\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#fdba74\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"34\" y=\"34\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#fdba74\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"8\" y=\"86\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#fdba74\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"34\" y=\"60\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#fdba74\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#fdba74\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"8\" y=\"34\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#fdba74\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"34\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#fdba74\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/></svg></div><p><b>Buna göre aşağıdaki motiflerden hangisi bu desende kullanılamaz?</b></p>",
