   "a": "D",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>k: x = −1,  m: y = 2,  A(2, 6)</li> <li>A′: A’nın k’ye göre; A″: A′’nün m’ye göre yansıması.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>AA′A″ üçgeninin çevresi.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>A′’yü bul</b> A, k’nin 3 birim sağında; A′ 3 birim solunda, aynı yükseklikte. <span class=\"sv-m\">A′(−4, 6),  |AA′| = 6</span></li> <li><b>A″’yü bul</b> A′, m’nin 4 birim üstünde; A″ 4 birim altında, aynı düşey doğruda. <span class=\"sv-m\">A″(−4, −2),  |A′A″| = 8</span></li> <li><b>Hipotenüs</b> [AA′] yatay, [A′A″] düşey olduğundan A′’de dik açı var. <span class=\"sv-m\">|AA″| = √(6² + 8²) = 10</span></li> <li><b>Çevre</b> Üç kenarı topla. <span class=\"sv-m\">6 + 8 + 10 = 24 birim</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 390\" width=\"360\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"k ve m doğruları; A, A′ ve A″ noktalarının oluşturduğu 6–8–10 dik üçgeni\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"360\" height=\"390\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><path d=\"M30 30V360M60 30V360M90 30V360M120 30V360M150 30V360M180 30V360M210 30V360M240 30V360M270 30V360M300 30V360M330 30V360M30 360H330M30 330H330M30 300H330M30 270H330M30 240H330M30 210H330M30 180H330M30 150H330M30 120H330M30 90H330M30 60H330M30 30H330\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M26 240H336 M210 364V24\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"342,240 334,236 334,244\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><polygon points=\"210,18 206,26 214,26\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"336\" y=\"232\" font-size=\"14\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#1e293b\">x</text><text x=\"218\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"14\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#1e293b\">y</text><g font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\"><text x=\"30\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−6</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−5</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−4</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−3</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−2</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−1</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"270\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"364.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">−4</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"334.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">−3</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"304.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">−2</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"274.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">−1</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"214.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"184.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"154.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">3</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"124.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">4</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"94.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">5</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"64.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">6</text><text x=\"205\" y=\"34.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">7</text><text x=\"206\" y=\"254\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text></g><line x1=\"180\" y1=\"360\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"180\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"180\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><polygon points=\"270,60 90,60 90,300\" fill=\"#bbf7d0\" fill-opacity=\"0.25\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><text x=\"185\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">k: x = −1</text><text x=\"326\" y=\"175\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" text-anchor=\"end\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">m: y = 2</text><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"60\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">A(2, 6)</text><circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"60\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"84\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">A′(−4, 6)</text><circle cx=\"90\" cy=\"300\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"98\" y=\"314\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">A″(−4, −2)</text><text x=\"135\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#16a34a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">6</text><text x=\"82\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#16a34a\" text-anchor=\"end\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">8</text><text x=\"235\" y=\"125\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#16a34a\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">10</text></svg><figcaption>A′ köşesinde dik açı vardır: kenarlar 6, 8, 10.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Dik iki doğruya göre art arda yansımada nokta, görüntüleriyle birlikte bir dik üçgen oluşturur.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Uzaklıkları ikiye katlamadan 3 + 4 + 5 = 12 almak; hipotenüsü unutmak 14 verir.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>D</b></div></div>"
