   "a": "C",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>A(3, 5), B(−1, 2); ℓ: y = 2x − 9</li> <li>d, x eksenine paralel; A’nın d’ye göre yansıması ℓ üzerinde.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>B’nin d’ye göre yansıması B′.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>A′’nün apsisi</b> d yatay olduğundan A′, A ile aynı düşey doğrudadır: apsisi 3.</li> <li><b>A′’nün ordinatı</b> A′ ℓ üzerinde olduğundan denklemde x = 3 yazalım. <span class=\"sv-m\">y = 2 · 3 − 9 = −3 → A′(3, −3)</span></li> <li><b>d’yi bul</b> d, [AA′]’nün orta noktasından geçer. <span class=\"sv-m\">(5 + (−3)) ÷ 2 = 1 → d: y = 1</span></li> <li><b>B′’yü bul</b> B, d’nin 1 birim üstünde; B′ 1 birim altında. <span class=\"sv-m\">B′(−1, 0)</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 372 400\" width=\"372\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"y = 1 doğrusu d, ℓ doğrusu; A ile A′ d’ye 4’er birim uzak, B ile B′ 1’er birim uzak\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"372\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><path d=\"M60 60V340M88 60V340M116 60V340M144 60V340M172 60V340M200 60V340M228 60V340M256 60V340M284 60V340M312 60V340M60 340H312M60 312H312M60 284H312M60 256H312M60 228H312M60 200H312M60 172H312M60 144H312M60 116H312M60 88H312M60 60H312\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M56 228H318 M144 344V54\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"324,228 316,224 316,232\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><polygon points=\"144,48 140,56 148,56\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"318\" y=\"220\" font-size=\"14\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#1e293b\">x</text><text x=\"152\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"14\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#1e293b\">y</text><g font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\"><text x=\"60\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−3</text><text x=\"88\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−2</text><text x=\"116\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−1</text><text x=\"172\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text x=\"228\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><text x=\"284\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><text x=\"312\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><text x=\"139\" y=\"344.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">−4</text><text x=\"139\" y=\"316.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">−3</text><text x=\"139\" y=\"288.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">−2</text><text x=\"139\" y=\"260.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">−1</text><text x=\"139\" y=\"204.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><text x=\"139\" y=\"176.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><text x=\"139\" y=\"148.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">3</text><text x=\"139\" y=\"120.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">4</text><text x=\"139\" y=\"92.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">5</text><text x=\"139\" y=\"64.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">6</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"242\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text></g><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"312\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><line x1=\"214\" y1=\"340\" x2=\"312\" y2=\"144\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><line x1=\"228\" y1=\"88\" x2=\"228\" y2=\"312\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><text x=\"308\" y=\"195\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"end\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">d: y = 1</text><text x=\"306\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">ℓ</text><circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"88\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"236\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">A(3, 5)</text><circle cx=\"228\" cy=\"312\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#7c3aed\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"316\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" text-anchor=\"end\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">A′(3, −3)</text><circle cx=\"116\" cy=\"172\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"122\" y=\"164\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">B(−1, 2)</text><circle cx=\"116\" cy=\"228\" r=\"6\" fill=\"#16a34a\"/><text x=\"106\" y=\"220\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#16a34a\" text-anchor=\"end\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">B′(−1, 0)</text><text x=\"234\" y=\"149\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">4</text><text x=\"234\" y=\"261\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#dc2626\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">4</text></svg><figcaption>A ile A′ d’ye 4’er birim, B ile B′ 1’er birim uzaktadır.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Yatay doğru y = k’ye göre yansımada apsis değişmez; k, nokta ile görüntüsünün ordinatlarının ortalamasıdır.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> d’yi x ekseni sanmak (−1, −2) verir.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>C</b></div></div>"
