   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>Mavi şeklin d’ye göre, kırmızı şeklin k’ye göre yansıması boyanacak.</li> <li>I, II, III, IV numaralı kareler d’nin sağında, k’nin altında.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>Hem maviye hem kırmızıya boyanan (mor) kare.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Mavinin d’ye göre görüntüsü</b> Kareler aynı satırda kalır, d’ye uzaklıkları korunarak sağa geçer. Görüntü, d’nin sağında k’nin altındaki bölgeye düşer. <span class=\"sv-m\">Maviye boyanan numaralı kareler: I ve II</span></li> <li><b>Kırmızının k’ye göre görüntüsü</b> Kareler aynı sütunda kalır, k’ye uzaklıkları korunarak aşağı geçer. <span class=\"sv-m\">Kırmızıya boyanan numaralı kareler: I ve III</span></li> <li><b>Ortak kare</b> İki listede de bulunan kare: <span class=\"sv-m\">I → mor</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 420 300\" width=\"420\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Mavi şeklin d’ye göre açık mavi, kırmızı şeklin k’ye göre açık kırmızı görüntüleri; ikisinin kesiştiği I numaralı kare mor\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><path d=\"M30 30V270M60 30V270M90 30V270M120 30V270M150 30V270M180 30V270M210 30V270M240 30V270M270 30V270M300 30V270M330 30V270M360 30V270M390 30V270M30 270H390M30 240H390M30 210H390M30 180H390M30 150H390M30 120H390M30 90H390M30 60H390M30 30H390\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"60\" y=\"210\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" fill-opacity=\"0.9\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"180\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" fill-opacity=\"0.9\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"90\" y=\"210\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" fill-opacity=\"0.9\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"120\" y=\"240\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" fill-opacity=\"0.9\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"300\" y=\"60\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" fill-opacity=\"0.9\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"300\" y=\"30\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" fill-opacity=\"0.9\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"270\" y=\"90\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" fill-opacity=\"0.9\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"330\" y=\"90\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" fill-opacity=\"0.9\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"270\" y=\"180\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fee2e2\" fill-opacity=\"0.8\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"270\" y=\"240\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" fill-opacity=\"0.7\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"300\" y=\"180\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" fill-opacity=\"0.7\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"300\" y=\"210\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#a855f7\" fill-opacity=\"0.9\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2.2\"/><rect x=\"300\" y=\"240\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fee2e2\" fill-opacity=\"0.8\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"330\" y=\"180\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fee2e2\" fill-opacity=\"0.8\" stroke=\"#b91c1c\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"330\" y=\"210\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#bfdbfe\" fill-opacity=\"0.7\" stroke=\"#1d4ed8\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"270\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"390\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">d</text><text x=\"386\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"end\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">k</text><text x=\"315\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">I</text><text x=\"345\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">II</text><text x=\"285\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">III</text><text x=\"285\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">IV</text></svg><figcaption>Açık mavi: mavinin görüntüsü; açık kırmızı: kırmızının görüntüsü; mor: ikisi birden (I).</figcaption></figure><table class=\"sv-c\"><tr class=\"ok\"><td>I</td><td>Mavi + kırmızı → mor ✓</td></tr><tr><td>II</td><td>Yalnız mavi ✗</td></tr><tr><td>III</td><td>Yalnız kırmızı ✗</td></tr><tr><td>IV</td><td>Hiçbiri ✗</td></tr></table><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> İki farklı yansımayı ayrı ayrı çiz, sonra ortak kareye bak.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Mavi şekli yansıtmadan ötelemek IV’ü boyar; yansımada IV boyanmaz.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>A</b></div></div>"
