   "lv": "zor",
   "q": "<p>Bir zekâ oyununda turuncu parça, gri kareli bölgenin üzerine yerleştirilecektir. Parça <b>döndürülemez ve ters çevrilemez</b>; yalnız ötelenerek taşınabilir. Parçanın her karesi bölgedeki bir gri karenin tam üstüne gelmeli ve parçanın hiçbir karesi gri bölgenin dışında kalmamalıdır.</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 412 216\" width=\"470\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Gri kareli bölge ve turuncu L biçimli parça\" font-family=\"sans-serif\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"412\" height=\"216\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"150\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"122\" y=\"38\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"66\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"122\" y=\"122\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"178\" y=\"122\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"38\" y=\"94\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"94\" y=\"94\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"66\" y=\"66\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"206\" y=\"94\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"94\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"122\" y=\"150\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"122\" y=\"66\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"178\" y=\"150\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"178\" y=\"66\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"38\" y=\"122\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"94\" y=\"38\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"66\" y=\"94\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"94\" y=\"122\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"206\" y=\"122\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"122\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"178\" y=\"94\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"38\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"66\" y=\"122\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"38\" y=\"66\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"94\" y=\"150\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"66\" y=\"38\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"94\" y=\"66\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"206\" y=\"150\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><rect x=\"346\" y=\"122\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#fdba74\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"346\" y=\"94\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#fdba74\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"290\" y=\"122\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#fdba74\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><rect x=\"318\" y=\"122\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#fdba74\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><text x=\"332\" y=\"172.4\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">Parça</text></svg></div><p><b>Buna göre parça gri bölgeye kaç farklı konumda yerleştirilebilir?</b></p>",
