   "lv": "zor",
   "q": "<p>Koordinat düzleminde kenarları eksenlere paralel olan ABCD dikdörtgeni verilmiştir. (Şekil ölçekli değildir.)</p><div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 330 304\" width=\"360\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Koordinat düzleminde ABCD dikdörtgeni; A(−2, −1), D(−2, 5); B ve C’nin koordinatları verilmemiş; şekil ölçekli değil\" font-family=\"sans-serif\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"330\" height=\"304\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"204\" x2=\"308\" y2=\"204\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"308,204 299,199.5 299,208.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><polygon points=\"22,204 31,208.5 31,199.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><line x1=\"152\" y1=\"282\" x2=\"152\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"152,22 147.5,31 156.5,31\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><polygon points=\"152,282 156.5,273 147.5,273\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><polygon points=\"100,230 245.6,230 245.6,74 100,74\" fill=\"#93c5fd\" fill-opacity=\"0.8\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"230\" r=\"3.6\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"74\" r=\"3.6\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><circle cx=\"245.6\" cy=\"230\" r=\"3.6\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><circle cx=\"245.6\" cy=\"74\" r=\"3.6\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"312\" y=\"209\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">x</text><text x=\"158\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\">y</text><text x=\"148\" y=\"218\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\">O</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"248\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">A(−2, −1)</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"68\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">D(−2, 5)</text><text x=\"251.6\" y=\"248\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">B</text><text x=\"251.6\" y=\"68\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#1e293b\" font-weight=\"bold\">C</text></svg></div><p>ABCD dikdörtgeni ile bu dikdörtgenin y eksenine göre yansıması birlikte, köşeleri B, C ve bunların görüntüleri olan bir <b>kare</b> bölge oluşturuyor.</p><p><b>Buna göre ABCD dikdörtgeninin alanı kaç birimkaredir?</b></p>",
   "c": [
    "36",
    "30",
    "24",
    "18"
   ],
   "a": "B",
   "s": "<div class=\"sv\"><div class=\"sv-g\"><b>Verilen</b> <ul><li>ABCD: A(−2, −1), D(−2, 5); kenarlar eksenlere paralel.</li> <li>ABCD ile y eksenine göre yansımasının birleşimi bir kare.</li></ul><b>İstenen</b><p>ABCD dikdörtgeninin alanı.</p></div><ol class=\"sv-s\"><li><b>Yükseklik</b> A ile D aynı düşey doğrudadır. <span class=\"sv-m\">|AD| = 5 − (−1) = 6</span></li> <li><b>Birleşimin genişliği</b> B ve C’nin apsisi c olsun. Yansıma dikdörtgeni −c ile 2 arasına taşır; birleşim −c ile c arasındadır. <span class=\"sv-m\">Genişlik = 2c</span></li> <li><b>Kare şartı</b> Genişlik yüksekliğe eşit olmalı. <span class=\"sv-m\">2c = 6 → c = 3</span></li> <li><b>Alan</b> ABCD’nin genişliği 3 − (−2) = 5. <span class=\"sv-m\">5 · 6 = 30 birimkare</span></li></ol><figure class=\"sv-f\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 316 316\" width=\"316\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"ABCD dikdörtgeni, y eksenine göre sarı kesikli yansıması ve birleşimin yeşil 6×6 karesi\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"316\" height=\"316\" fill=\"#ffffff\"/><path d=\"M30 30V286M62 30V286M94 30V286M126 30V286M158 30V286M190 30V286M222 30V286M254 30V286M286 30V286M30 286H286M30 254H286M30 222H286M30 190H286M30 158H286M30 126H286M30 94H286M30 62H286M30 30H286\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"/><path d=\"M26 222H292 M158 290V24\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><polygon points=\"298,222 290,218 290,226\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><polygon points=\"158,18 154,26 162,26\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"292\" y=\"214\" font-size=\"14\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#1e293b\">x</text><text x=\"166\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"14\" font-style=\"italic\" fill=\"#1e293b\">y</text><g font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\"><text x=\"30\" y=\"237\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−4</text><text x=\"62\" y=\"237\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−3</text><text x=\"94\" y=\"237\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−2</text><text x=\"126\" y=\"237\" text-anchor=\"middle\">−1</text><text x=\"190\" y=\"237\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><text x=\"222\" y=\"237\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><text x=\"254\" y=\"237\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><text x=\"286\" y=\"237\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><text x=\"153\" y=\"290.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">−2</text><text x=\"153\" y=\"258.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">−1</text><text x=\"153\" y=\"194.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><text x=\"153\" y=\"162.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><text x=\"153\" y=\"130.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">3</text><text x=\"153\" y=\"98.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">4</text><text x=\"153\" y=\"66.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">5</text><text x=\"153\" y=\"34.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">6</text><text x=\"154\" y=\"236\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text></g><polygon points=\"62,254 254,254 254,62 62,62\" fill=\"none\" fill-opacity=\"1\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"94,254 254,254 254,62 94,62\" fill=\"#a5f3fc\" fill-opacity=\"0.35\" stroke=\"#0e7490\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"62,254 222,254 222,62 62,62\" fill=\"#fde047\" fill-opacity=\"0.35\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"94\" cy=\"254\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"end\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">A</text><circle cx=\"94\" cy=\"62\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"56\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"end\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">D</text><circle cx=\"254\" cy=\"254\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"254\" y=\"272\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">B(3, −1)</text><circle cx=\"254\" cy=\"62\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#1e293b\"/><text x=\"254\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">C(3, 5)</text><text x=\"158\" y=\"54\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#16a34a\" text-anchor=\"middle\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">2c = 6</text><text x=\"262\" y=\"163\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#16a34a\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"3\" paint-order=\"stroke\">6</text></svg><figcaption>Birleşim −3 ile 3 arasında, 6 × 6’lık bir karedir.</figcaption></figure><div class=\"sv-t\"><b>Püf nokta:</b> Bir şekil y eksenine göre yansıtılınca birleşimin sağ ucu ile sol ucu eksene eşit uzaklıktadır.</div><div class=\"sv-w\"><b>Tuzak:</b> Karenin alanını (36) ya da ortak bölgenin alanını (24) cevap sanmak.</div><div class=\"sv-a\">Cevap <b>B</b></div></div>"
